{"id":"6efb0e699c13a985","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-ground-term-algebra-initial.md","title":"基项代数在所有Σ代数中初始","display":"thm-ground-term-algebra-initial — 基项代数在所有Σ代数中初始","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-ground-term-algebra-initial","aliases":["56-thm-ground-term-algebra-initial"],"display":"thm-ground-term-algebra-initial — 基项代数在所有Σ代数中初始","depends_on":["[[56-df-ground-term-algebra]]","[[56-df-initial-algebra]]","[[56-df-satisfaction]]"],"source_section":"7.1.5–7.1.6; 7.2.1; 7.2.5","source_pages":"262; 266–267","source_ocr_blocks":[283,287,288],"source_statement_status":"source-definitions-and-exercise-specialized","source_proof_status":"local-ground-term-recursion-and-uniqueness-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-ground-term-algebra-initial"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-ground-term-algebra-initial</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ground-term-algebra-initial — 基项代数在所有Σ代数中初始"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"10806b2bbdb74dae\" href=\"?note=10806b2bbdb74dae\" title=\"56-df-ground-term-algebra\">56-df-ground-term-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0a8374d48d26bd5\" href=\"?note=a0a8374d48d26bd5\" title=\"56-df-initial-algebra\">56-df-initial-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b729ff69dbfa830d\" href=\"?note=b729ff69dbfa830d\" title=\"56-df-satisfaction\">56-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"7.1.5–7.1.6; 7.2.1; 7.2.5"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"262; 266–267"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>283</span><span>287</span><span>288</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-definitions-and-exercise-specialized"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-ground-term-recursion-and-uniqueness-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(G,I_G)=\\mathbf T_0(\\Sigma,V)\">\\((G,I_G)=\\mathbf T_0(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"10806b2bbdb74dae\" href=\"?note=10806b2bbdb74dae\" title=\"56-df-ground-term-algebra\">56-df-ground-term-algebra</a>，并假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(G\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。初始性取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a0a8374d48d26bd5\" href=\"?note=a0a8374d48d26bd5\" title=\"56-df-initial-algebra\">56-df-initial-algebra</a>；目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>-代数的解释与赋值取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b729ff69dbfa830d\" href=\"?note=b729ff69dbfa830d\" title=\"56-df-satisfaction\">56-df-satisfaction</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,\\varnothing}(G,I_G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,\\varnothing}(G,I_G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\forall J\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}B^{B^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}}\\;\n\\exists!h\\in B^G\\;\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(G,I_G,B,J,h).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall B\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\forall J\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}B^{B^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}}\\;\n\\exists!h\\in B^G\\;\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(G,I_G,B,J,h).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 Definitions 7.1.5、7.2.1 与 Exercise 7.2.5 在E=∅时的基础特例。本地构造h：把每个基项按其函数符号在(B,J)中解释。因基项无变量，取值与赋值无关，结构递归给出全函数及同态性。任一同态必须把常元映到其解释，并逐层保持构造运算，对基项结构归纳便知它等于h。G≠∅是必需条件，而非可省略的读者常识。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003，7.1.5–7.1.6; 7.2.1; 7.2.5，印刷页 262; 266–267。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 为本地DjVu文字层页块序号，不是物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-ground-term-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"10806b2bbdb74dae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-ground-term-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-initial-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a0a8374d48d26bd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-initial-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"b729ff69dbfa830d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-ground-term-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"10806b2bbdb74dae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$V$ 固定，$(G,I_G)=\\mathbf T_0(\\Sigma,V)$ 如 [[56-df-ground-term-algebra]]，并假设 $G\\ne\\varnothing$。初始性取 [[56-df-initial-algebra]]；目标 $\\Sigma$-代数的解释与赋值取 [[56-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-initial-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a0a8374d48d26bd5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$V$ 固定，$(G,I_G)=\\mathbf T_0(\\Sigma,V)$ 如 [[56-df-ground-term-algebra]]，并假设 $G\\ne\\varnothing$。初始性取 [[56-df-initial-algebra]]；目标 $\\Sigma$-代数的解释与赋值取 [[56-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"b729ff69dbfa830d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$V$ 固定，$(G,I_G)=\\mathbf T_0(\\Sigma,V)$ 如 [[56-df-ground-term-algebra]]，并假设 $G\\ne\\varnothing$。初始性取 [[56-df-initial-algebra]]；目标 $\\Sigma$-代数的解释与赋值取 [[56-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"(G,I_G)=\\mathbf T_0(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"G\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,\\varnothing}(G,I_G).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall B\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\forall J\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}B^{B^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}}\\;\n\\exists!h\\in B^G\\;\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(G,I_G,B,J,h).","display":true}],"bytes":1855,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-258","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-ground-term-algebra-initial.md]]"},{"id":"94ce4cc247b1553c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["10806b2bbdb74dae","a0a8374d48d26bd5","b729ff69dbfa830d"]}